.2025.01.020) /Title (Application of IoT and blockchain technology in the integration of innovation and industrial chains in high-tech manufacturing) /Keywords (Industrial ioT,Anomaly detection,Blockchain technology,Predictive maintenance,Smart manufacturing,Real-time ioT monitoring,Secure ioT data management,Data quality) /CreationDate (D:20250208150141Z) /Producer (Acrobat Distiller 8.1.0 \(Windows\)) /Subject (Alexandria Engineering Journal, 119 \(2025\) 465-477. doi:10.1016/j.aej.2025.01.020) /CrossMarkDomains#5B2#5D (sciencedirect.com) /CrossmarkDomainExclusive (true)>>endobj655 0 obj<< /Marked true>>endobj656 0 obj<< /Dests 337 0 R>>endobj657 0 obj<< /Type /OutputIntent /S /GTS_PDFA1 /OutputConditionIdentifier (IEC sRGB) /DestOutputProfile 659 0 R /RegistryName <feff0068007400740070003a002f002f007700770077002e006900650063002e00630068> /Info (IEC 61966-2.1 Default RGB colour space - sRGB)>>endobj658 0 obj<< /Length 304 /Filter /FlateDecode /Type /SourceFile /SourceName (aej5865-docdetails.tex)>>stream
